{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/worldsnapshot"]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"externalID":"s:11WorldModule0A8SnapshotV","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WorldSnapshot","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WorldSnapshot","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","title":"WorldSnapshot","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Snapshot.swift#L33","fileName":"Snapshot.swift"},"symbolKind":"struct"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot"},"abstract":[{"text":"A saved copy of a world’s entities, hierarchy and the components of the listed types.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot\/init(from:)"],"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot\/count"],"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot\/encode(to:)"],"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot\/Equatable-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/Se","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/SE","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/SQ","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Scene","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistry","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistryError","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/MapEntities"],"title":"Saving and Loading Worlds","generated":true,"anchor":"Saving-and-Loading-Worlds"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WorldSnapshot","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Decodable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Se"},{"text":", repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Encodable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SE"},{"text":", repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component","text":"Component","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9ComponentP"}]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use a snapshot to save a world and restore it later, or to compare two worlds. A snapshot"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Codable"},{"type":"text","text":", so you can encode it with any encoder, such as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"JSONEncoder"},{"type":"text","text":". Take one with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/snapshot(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", listing the component types to save, and rebuild a world from it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"World(restoring:)"},{"type":"text","text":". Each component type you save must conform to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Codable"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example saves a world as JSON and restores it:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import Foundation","","var world = World()","let ship = world.spawn(Position(x: 1, y: 2), Health(current: 3))","let data = try JSONEncoder().encode(world.snapshot(Position.self, Health.self))","","let decoded = try JSONDecoder().decode(WorldSnapshot<Position, Health>.self, from: data)","let restored = World(restoring: decoded)","print(restored[Position.self, of: ship])","\/\/ Prints \"Position(x: 1.0, y: 2.0)\""],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every entity handle, live or stale, means the same in the restored world as in the original,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so handles you saved elsewhere stay valid. The restored world also hands out the same handles"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from later spawns."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A snapshot holds no resources, hooks or change ticks, and the restored world’s components"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are all added at its first tick. To save resources too, or to save a world without listing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its types at each call, use a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Scene","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"name":"Note","style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Decoding throws "},{"code":"DecodingError.dataCorrupted","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for data that no world could have"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"produced, such as a component of an entity that isn’t live."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://WorldModule/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"title":"Swift.SendableMetatype","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://WorldModule/SE":{"title":"Swift.Encodable","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/SE","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/WorldSnapshot":{"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/worldsnapshot","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"WorldSnapshot"}],"role":"symbol","title":"WorldSnapshot","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A saved copy of a world’s entities, hierarchy and the components of the listed types."}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"WorldSnapshot"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/WorldSnapshot/init(from:)":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Creates a snapshot by decoding from the given decoder.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot\/init(from:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/worldsnapshot\/init(from:)","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s7DecoderP","text":"Decoder"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"title":"init(from:)"},"do